nt three  to five slides  of the idea that you have like we saw  rudy present she has an  idea right now on how to work on medulla  blastoma but  she is not very well defined the idea is  not yet defined the idea is there she  has a certain  interest in that topic she has found  some data sets but she still needs to  identify  what is the research topic that she has  right so  these are how we move through so there  are these 20 steps that we are following  through and it's a very step-by-step and  defined process and  as you see most of the participants who  have followed through these steps  have had this outcome where they are  able to present  and then translate it some of our  participants that we will be updating  here are also going to have poster  presentations  they'll be speaking at conferences so  you can imagine that once you have a  project done  you can take it from to anywhere so it's  up to you how much research  you want to do some of the times our  participants  are very happy completing a project and  you know then applying or adding it to  their cvs  and it's of course very helpful for  career growth  the other times they're also interested  in pursuing further research  in the topic and identifying any other  gaps that they may have  in the answer in answering the question  that they were trying to answer  and go and research for it for years as  well  and then you can present it you can  attend  some seminars where you can like you  know present it to a larger community  and not just you know very localized  community and what we will try to do  is help you present it in our meeting so  we continue to have these webinars  we continue to have these meetings that  we have as part of psionics club  and we welcome you all to join this from  time to time  and now again if you have any questions  please feel free to ask those questions  to me  and if you do not have any questions  then thank you all again for joining  today it was wonderful to listen to  all the presenters and i do hope to see  more participation from everybody in  this club and again  please feel free to reach out to us  anytime thank you so much  thank you rudhvi and thank you everybody  else  for participating in today's session  you
 

